sequenceDiagram
  participant P5
  participant Bus as OutboxInbox
  participant P7
  P5->>Bus: authorization.revoked.v1
  Bus->>P7: Deliver revoke
  P7->>P7: Apply monotonic revocation_version
  alt Request not started
    P7->>P7: SUPERSEDED_BY_REVOKE
  else Future in-flight workflow
    P7->>P7: Stop new steps compensate per policy
  else Already activated
    P7->>P7: No auto destroy require lifecycle auth
  end
  P7->>P5: Optional sync verify before sensitive ops
